        "src": "content/artwork/curated/military-art/US_Navy_060215-N-9500T-045_The_Los_Angeles-class_fast_attack_submarine_USS_Asheville_(SSN_758)%2C_gets_underway_in_preparation_of_conducting_high-speed_surface_drills_off_the_coast_of_Southern_California.jpg",
